Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:34:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(proposal): G205-B pure reconciliation, closing,
 compaction and retirement plans

Pure functions, no I/O: SUPERSEDED when the canon is newer, PUBLISHED
recovery after a crash past the rename, ABANDONED only after a grace
delay (WAIT when the age is unknown), integrity alert on same revision
with other content, manifest-driven ENQUEUE for lost events and index
orphans; compaction limited to terminal rows below active readers;
generation retirement never touches the live, read or recent ones.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
